cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, we'd be grateful if you cited it as below. A credit link is welcome but never required."
type: dataset
title: "Bible Data from Christian Pure"
abstract: >-
  Nine open datasets behind Christian Pure's free Bible and church tools: Paul's missionary
  journeys (stops, legs and places, as CSV and GeoJSON); 378 saints with their feast days in
  the Western and Orthodox calendars, patronages and sources; 22 Christian churches and
  traditions, and Protestants in general, on 55 questions, each answered from the church's
  own documents; Western and Orthodox Easter dates from 1900 to 2099; the 1,247 places the
  Bible names, from Genesis to Revelation, with their names in 11 languages; and over 6,500 Bible subjects with
  their verses; 25 earthquakes, eclipses and famines from the Bible and the early church, set
  against the scientific record and graded; the sky over Jerusalem from 1000 BC to AD 135, with
  the start of every Hebrew month by crescent sighting, the date and weekday of Passover in every
  year and every eclipse seen from Jerusalem, Samaria and Nineveh; and the church's Easter full moon
  beside the real one for every year from AD 325 to 2100.
authors:
  - name: "Christian Pure"
    website: "https://christianpure.com/"
